  "adaptations": [
    "Relocate shared modules to jiuwenswarm.lh while preserving serialized long_horizon keys.",
    "Keep the existing Jiuwen-only --lh and --run-json CLI; expose new suite budget/review options.",
    "Omit Chrys/ACP, SDK external drivers, benchmark launchers and C7 code. Include candidate archive, check receipt and delivery helpers used by the controller.",
    "Extract source_files, _safe_path and copy_files from terminal.py into workspace_files.py for delivery.",
    "Keep MemGraph naming and disabled default, native transport retry rail and public-test write guard.",
    "Tests use explicit asyncio markers, embedded package/fixture paths and fake-native startup for protocol controls.",
    "Admit the native template's documented browser credential variable names and bind their resolved environment to session continuation.",
    "Embed the modern WorkRuntime source under jiuwenswarm.pact_core for both suite and benchmark. Internal imports use the package namespace. Keep upstream schema identifiers and resource bytes. Retire the standalone Campaign command and its dedicated adapter."
  ],
